<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>05 / 教师端</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>统一任务预算：防止任务叠加</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 700, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={700} height={280} viewBox='0 0 700 280'><text x='0' y='34' font-size='16' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>学校作业</text><rect x='230' y='12' width='180' height='36' rx='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='230' y='12' width='400' height='36' rx='4' fill='#E3E8EF' opacity='0.25'/><rect x='230' y='12' width='180' height='36' rx='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='646' y='34' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='700'>45%</text><text x='0' y='104' font-size='16' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>个人助教补练</text><rect x='230' y='82' width='100' height='36' rx='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='230' y='82' width='400' height='36' rx='4' fill='#E3E8EF' opacity='0.25'/><rect x='230' y='82' width='100' height='36' rx='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='646' y='104' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='700'>25%</text><text x='0' y='174' font-size='16' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>套路训练与复习</text><rect x='230' y='152' width='88' height='36' rx='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='230' y='152' width='400' height='36' rx='4' fill='#E3E8EF' opacity='0.25'/><rect x='230' y='152' width='88' height='36' rx='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='646' y='174' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='700'>22%</text><text x='0' y='244' font-size='16' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='600'>诊断任务</text><rect x='230' y='222' width='32' height='36' rx='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='230' y='222' width='400' height='36' rx='4' fill='#E3E8EF' opacity='0.25'/><rect x='230' y='222' width='32' height='36' rx='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='646' y='244' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='start' font-weight='700'>8%</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>预算机制</Text><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>学校作业、个人助教补练、套路复习与诊断共用一份任务清单和时间预算。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>教师可查看重复任务、预计总量与实际用时。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>新增复习或补练时同步安排替代或延期，保留共同必做任务的调整权。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>分组随表现变化而调整，不将学生固定成某一能力等级。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>比较完成情况时考虑不同学生任务内容与难度的差异。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：教师端设计思路.md §4；试卷与生涯维度设计思路.md §9.5</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 53 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>